> Mr. Red loved colors. He loved puppets. He loved robots. And most of all, he loved making things that could surprise people.
> 
> So he asked himself:
> 
> **“What if colors could come alive?”**
> 
> He worked all night in his workshop, with bubbling tubes, glowing wires, and giant paint tanks. He mixed **blue bravery**, **green curiosity**, **orange hunger**, **purple sneaking**, and **yellow soaring** into strange machines.
> 
> Then one stormy night—
> 
> **BOOM!**
> 
> Lightning flashed.
> The power flickered.
> The rainbow paint glowed brighter and brighter.
> 
> And suddenly, the colors woke up.
